# Slack webhook (local only, git-ignored)

Copy this file to .claude/slack.local.md (same folder, without ".example") and paste the webhook URL
after the colon below. Ask the team for the URL in a private message.
Never paste it into chat, Jira, Slack or any other file. git ignores .claude/slack.local.md, never this example.

- SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL: PASTE_WEBHOOK_URL_HERE
